{"comment": "alice plays yahtzee alone, a game that also takes up to three opponents, so game.start seats her as p1. She rolls, holds a die, rolls again, scores chance and gives up. The dice come from the random seed, so they and the scores they make are placeholders; a reused placeholder must take the same value, so the rolled event carries the dice the view shows."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 1, "type": "auth.login", "body": {"v": 1, "username": "alice", "password": "correct horse"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 1, "type": "ok", "body": {"user": "alice", "heartbeat_ms": 15000}}}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 2, "type": "game.start", "body": {"game": "yahtzee", "options": {}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "yahtzee", "options": {}, "seq": 0, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}], "to_act": ["alice"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign", "abort"], "events": [], "view": {"round": 1, "dice": [], "held": [false, false, false, false, false], "rolls_left": 3, "cards": [{"seat": "p1", "scores": {}, "upper_total": 0, "upper_bonus": 0, "yahtzee_bonus": 0, "total": 0, "out": false}], "can_roll": true, "can_hold": false, "options": []}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 2, "type": "ok", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "yahtzee", "options": {}, "seq": 0, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}], "to_act": ["alice"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign", "abort"], "events": [], "view": {"round": 1, "dice": [], "held": [false, false, false, false, false], "rolls_left": 3, "cards": [{"seat": "p1", "scores": {}, "upper_total": 0, "upper_bonus": 0, "yahtzee_bonus": 0, "total": 0, "out": false}], "can_roll": true, "can_hold": false, "options": []}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"comment": "Before the first roll there is nothing to hold or score: can_hold is false and options is []."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 3, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "action": {"kind": "score", "box": "chance"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 3, "type": "error", "body": {"code": "illegal_action", "message": "roll first"}}}
{"comment": "A roll throws every die not held. The roller is offered every open box with what it would score now."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 4, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "action": {"kind": "roll"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "yahtzee", "options": {}, "seq": 1, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}], "to_act": ["alice"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign"], "events": [{"by": "p1", "dice": "$dice1", "kind": "rolled"}], "view": {"round": 1, "dice": "$dice1", "held": [false, false, false, false, false], "rolls_left": 2, "cards": [{"seat": "p1", "scores": {}, "upper_total": 0, "upper_bonus": 0, "yahtzee_bonus": 0, "total": 0, "out": false}], "can_roll": true, "can_hold": true, "options": "$options1"}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 4, "type": "ok", "body": {"seq": 1}}}
{"comment": "hold toggles one die, 1 to 5; it emits no event."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 5, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 1, "action": {"kind": "hold", "die": "1"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "yahtzee", "options": {}, "seq": 2, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}], "to_act": ["alice"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign"], "events": [], "view": {"round": 1, "dice": "$dice1", "held": [true, false, false, false, false], "rolls_left": 2, "cards": [{"seat": "p1", "scores": {}, "upper_total": 0, "upper_bonus": 0, "yahtzee_bonus": 0, "total": 0, "out": false}], "can_roll": true, "can_hold": true, "options": "$options1"}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 5, "type": "ok", "body": {"seq": 2}}}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 6, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 2, "action": {"kind": "hold", "die": "6"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 6, "type": "error", "body": {"code": "illegal_action", "message": "die must be 1 to 5, got \"6\""}}}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 7, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 2, "action": {"kind": "roll"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "yahtzee", "options": {}, "seq": 3, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}], "to_act": ["alice"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign"], "events": [{"by": "p1", "dice": "$dice3", "kind": "rolled"}], "view": {"round": 1, "dice": "$dice3", "held": [true, false, false, false, false], "rolls_left": 1, "cards": [{"seat": "p1", "scores": {}, "upper_total": 0, "upper_bonus": 0, "yahtzee_bonus": 0, "total": 0, "out": false}], "can_roll": true, "can_hold": true, "options": "$options3"}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 7, "type": "ok", "body": {"seq": 3}}}
{"comment": "Scoring ends the turn: the card shows the box, and the next turn starts with no dice, no holds and three rolls. Chance is always open in round 1, and no Yahtzee bonus is possible yet."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 8, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 3, "action": {"kind": "score", "box": "chance"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "yahtzee", "options": {}, "seq": 4, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}], "to_act": ["alice"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign"], "events": [{"box": "chance", "by": "p1", "kind": "scored", "score": "$chance", "yahtzee_bonus": 0}], "view": {"round": 2, "dice": [], "held": [false, false, false, false, false], "rolls_left": 3, "cards": [{"seat": "p1", "scores": {"chance": "$chance"}, "upper_total": 0, "upper_bonus": 0, "yahtzee_bonus": 0, "total": "$chance", "out": false}], "can_roll": true, "can_hold": false, "options": []}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 8, "type": "ok", "body": {"seq": 4}}}
{"comment": "Giving up is the resign control: a solo loss with no winner. The card stays, marked out, and the final view offers nothing. The summary's score is the card total, as every Yahtzee game scores."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 9, "type": "game.control", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 4, "control": "resign"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "yahtzee", "options": {}, "seq": 5, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}], "to_act": [], "result": {"kind": "decisive", "winners": [], "reason": "resign"}, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": [], "events": [], "view": {"round": 2, "dice": [], "held": [false, false, false, false, false], "rolls_left": 3, "cards": [{"seat": "p1", "scores": {"chance": "$chance"}, "upper_total": 0, "upper_bonus": 0, "yahtzee_bonus": 0, "total": "$chance", "out": true}], "can_roll": false, "can_hold": false, "options": []}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": "$finished_at", "summary": "$summary", "digest": "$digest", "exports": {}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 9, "type": "ok", "body": {"seq": 5}}}
